{"id": 73, "name": "Harith", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b798782cb64820af74f9365dbbf4689.png", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Damage"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["40", "50", "10", "50"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", "Jungle"], "story": "Leonin boy who came to the Moniyan Empire from Azrya.", "skills": [{"name": "Key Insight", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f5ef9a005278e374f023e9279989be02.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Harith gains insight from his Key. He gains 7% Hybrid Lifesteal for each nearby enemy hero, stacking up to 35%."}, {"name": "Synchro Fission", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f23c4399892794ed73e58a29352273c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Harith creates a phantom of himself in a distant location. Harith and his phantom then release <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Synchro Fission</span> toward each other, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemy units on the path.\n\nWhen the 2 energy waves collide, they explode, dealing 450<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+180% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in the area.\nThis skill deals 60% extra damage to creeps (up to 1500 damage)."}, {"name": "Chrono Dash", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0db4fd70a127b1733a6fc10261d4c5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 9.3   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Harith dashes towards the target direction, gaining a 120<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+120% Total Magic Power)</span> shield and enhancing his next Basic Attack. Harith's enhanced Basic Attack deals 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+70% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slows enemies by 40%. Hitting an enemy with Harith's enhanced Basic Attack reduces the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chrono Dash</span> by 3s. This shield can stack up to 3 times.\n\nThe enhanced Basic Attack only deals 50<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to Turrets."}, {"name": "Zaman Force", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_47c6f8c53a894420ae9c8ae05a81fa47.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "Harith uses his Key to summon the Zaman Force, creating a multidimensional rift. Upon appearance, it reduces the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chrono Dash</span> by 4s. The rift continuously slows enemy heroes in the area by 40%.\n\nWhen Harith comes into contact with the rift using <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chrono Dash</span>, he absorbs its energy, reducing the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Synchro Fission</span> by 1s and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chrono Dash</span> by 3s. Harith gains 15% Resilience while on the rift."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Magic Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_80a7900e7afd6a7f63384c781b043d33.png"}, {"name": "Starlium Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d63b065df23070a6b69328482efc6efa.png"}, {"name": "Feather of Heaven", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e3c784601c1f2addd276194bf0b27ebe.pn